WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.275
A sprite has a position and a velocity.

2
00:00:03.903 --> 00:00:07.953
Position is where it is now. Setting it moves the sprite once.

3
00:00:08.907 --> 00:00:13.832
Velocity is a speed. The engine moves the sprite a little every frame.

4
00:00:16.666 --> 00:00:21.691
So it keeps moving until something changes it, like a wall or a new speed.
